00:11:32,679 --> 00:11:36,279
Think of it like medication for high blood pressure or high cholesterol.

281
00:11:36,279 --> 00:11:38,120
You need to keep taking it for it to keep working.

282
00:11:38,120 --> 00:11:41,399
So what do doctors usually advise if someone has to stop or wants to?

283
00:11:41,399 --> 00:11:42,399
