284
00:11:42,399 --> 00:11:47,679
Well, the strong clinical advice is usually to continue if possible and polluated.

285
00:11:48,359 --> 00:11:52,919
The American Diabetes Association points out that stopping usually means regaining half

286
00:11:52,919 --> 00:11:56,000
to two thirds of the weight within a year.

287
00:11:56,000 --> 00:12:00,959
If stopping is necessary, the recommendation is usually taper off the dose gradually,

