Maybe only eating within an eight-hour window each day.

328
00:14:06,240 --> 00:14:11,519
Or it could be alternate day fasting or even just skipping breakfast a few times a week.

329
00:14:11,519 --> 00:14:13,879
There's also the omad approach.

