00:15:26,519 --> 00:15:31,639
It's like your body's cellular cleanup crew, getting the damage components, recycling parts.

356
00:15:31,639 --> 00:15:34,319
It's thought to be important for healthy aging.

357
00:15:34,319 --> 00:15:39,039
Some early human data also suggests IF might have benefits beyond just weight loss, like

358
00:15:39,039 --> 00:15:40,039
